78. Metric glossary

Every normalized metric in UI has a tooltip.

Example:

Comparable Sales

A company-defined measure of sales growth at eligible existing locations. Eligibility windows and adjustments differ by company.

Transactions / Traffic

Reported change in transaction count, comparable transactions, guest counts, or traffic. Native metric is preserved because these are not always identical.

Average Ticket / Check

Reported change in spend per transaction/check. It can reflect price, product mix, quantity, and other factors; it is not automatically equivalent to price inflation.

This language is important.

